# Game Logic

This project implements the game of Go/Weiqi, an ancient board game with simple rules but complex strategy.

## Core Game Logic

- [GoGameLogic.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/GoGameLogic.java) - Backend game logic implementation
- [board-utils.ts](mdc:goweb/src/lib/game/board-utils.ts) - Frontend board utilities

## Game Data Structures

- [GameRoom.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/model/GameRoom.java) - Backend game room model
- [Player.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/model/Player.java) - Player model
- [go.ts](mdc:goweb/src/lib/types/go.ts) - Frontend Go/Weiqi game types
- [game-types.ts](mdc:goweb/src/types/game-types.ts) - Frontend game type definitions

## Board Constants

- [board.ts](mdc:goweb/src/lib/constants/board.ts) - Board size and other constants
